{
  "file": "home.html",
  "title": "Štefan Šraga – Photography, Video & Creative Marketing, Gaming and Esport",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "SINCE 2015",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">SINCE 2015</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "INTRO",
      "html": "<h2 class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">INTRO</span></h2>"
    },
    {
      "text": "Marketing strategist. Photo & video creator. I’m Štefan Šraga — and I believe every detail tells a story worth sharing. With years of experience, I understand how to capture attention, evoke emotion, and turn ideas into visuals that resonate.",
      "html": "<h2 class=\"font_2 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Marketing strategist. Photo &amp; video creator. I’m <span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:500;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Štefan Šraga</span></span></span><span class=\"color_18 wixui-rich-text__text\"> </span>— and I believe <span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:500;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">every detail</span></span></span> tells a story worth sharing. With years of experience, I understand how to capture attention, evoke emotion, and <span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:500;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">turn ideas into visuals</span></span></span> that <span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:500;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">resonate</span></span></span>.</span></h2>"
    },
    {
      "text": "Each video should be unique. I’m delighted to present my video creations here.",
      "html": "<h4 class=\"font_4 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:500;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Each video</span></span> should be <span style=\"font-weight:500;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">unique</span></span>. I’m delighted to present my video creations here.</h4>"
    },
    {
      "text": "As an example of the type of work featured here, a video from the Intel Extreme Masters event has already gained over 100,000 views.",
      "html": "<h4 class=\"font_4 wixui-rich-text__text\">As&nbsp;an&nbsp;example&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;type&nbsp;of&nbsp;work&nbsp;featured&nbsp;here,&nbsp;a&nbsp;video&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;Intel&nbsp;Extreme&nbsp;Masters&nbsp;event&nbsp;has&nbsp;already&nbsp;gained<span style=\"font-weight:normal;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">over 100,000&nbsp;views</span></span>.</h4>"
    },
    {
      "text": "INTRO",
      "html": "<h2 class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">INTRO</span></h2>"
    },
    {
      "text": "My Services",
      "html": "<h2 class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\">My Services</h2>"
    },
    {
      "text": "(0,1,255)",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">(0,1,255)</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "PHOTOGRAPHY",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\">PHOTOGRAPHY</p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "Moments fade, but photographs remain. I capture the emotions and atmosphere of your unforgettable events. Get in touch, and let’s create your own gallery of memories together.",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Moments fade, but photographs remain. I capture the emotions and atmosphere of your unforgettable events. Get in touch, and let’s create your own gallery of memories together.</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "MARKETING",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\">MARKETING</p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "Marketing is the cornerstone of success. I can help you with digital marketing, branding, and fine-tuning your social media presence. Let’s make your project stand out together.",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Marketing is the cornerstone of success. I can help you with digital marketing, branding, and fine-tuning your social media presence. Let’s make your project stand out together.</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "VIDEO",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\">VIDEO</p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "Moments fade, but photographs remain. I capture the emotions and atmosphere of your unforgettable events. Get in touch, and let’s create your own gallery of memories together.",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Moments fade, but photographs remain. I capture the emotions and atmosphere of your unforgettable events. Get in touch, and let’s create your own gallery of memories together.</span></p>"
    },
