    },
    {
      "text": "PHOTOGRAPHY",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\">PHOTOGRAPHY</p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "Details define the feeling. Through still images, I preserve emotions and atmosphere in a timeless form, creating photographs that hold meaning long after the experience itself. Together, we’ll build a gallery that speaks without words.",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\">Details define the feeling. Through still images, I preserve emotions and atmosphere in a timeless form, creating photographs that hold meaning long after the experience itself. Together, we’ll build a gallery that speaks without words.</p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "MARKETING",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\">MARKETING</p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "Strategy shapes visibility. I help brands grow through thoughtful digital marketing, connecting email campaigns, branding, and content with functional websites and e-shops designed to convert, from idea to launch.",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\">Strategy shapes visibility. I help brands grow through thoughtful digital marketing, connecting email campaigns, branding, and content with functional websites and e-shops designed to convert, from idea to launch.</p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "VIDEO",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\">VIDEO</p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ideas come to life through motion. I create cinematic videos for events, brands, and campaigns, capturing emotion, energy, and atmosphere in a way that feels natural and engaging. From dynamic event films to polished commercial spots, let’s shape a visual story that connects and lasts.",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\">Ideas come to life through motion. I create cinematic videos for events, brands, and campaigns, capturing emotion, energy, and atmosphere in a way that feels natural and engaging. From dynamic event films to polished commercial spots, let’s shape a visual story that connects and lasts.</p>"
    },
